```mdl
verdict addVoxels: addVoxels skips coordinates already occupied instead of overwriting them.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-voxel/src/types/VoxelOperation.ts#AddVoxels, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-voxel/src/operations/add-voxels.ts]
  note: The spec says existing voxels are overwritten; the handler only writes keys not already in the map (`if (!(key in voxelMap))`), so a hue change at an occupied cell is dropped. No test.
```

